;; db: bench_wcoj_hub
;; Key-simple directed-triangle worst case for join3.  For every
;; spoke->hub driver row, edge[hub,C] has n values while edge[spoke,C]
;; contains only the hub; their C sets are disjoint.  Prefix existence
;; filtering passes, so a binary plan still enumerates n^2 two-paths.

table (edge int int)
table (tri int int int)

rule (edge A B) (edge B C) (edge A C) --> (tri A B C)
